WEBVTT

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:13.550
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.130
<i>Right now, I'm in this mysterious 
world that isn't Earth,</i>

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:30.560
<i>confronted with a reality I've 
never experienced in my life.</i>

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.260
Huh?! Hey! What's going on?!

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.030
Huh?!

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:50.780
Uh...

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.980
Seiichi!

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.040
<i>They're pressing against me! 
They're pressing agaisnt me!</i>

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.790
I love you, Seiichi!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:10.540
Huh?

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.550
So please marry me!

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:19.300
What?!

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:23.700
No, no, this is all kinds of crazy!

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.810
A beautiful, stark-naked 
woman proposing to me?!

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.830
I mean... I mean...

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.740
Before I came to this world, I was...

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:34.680
Hey, what are you doing after this?

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.460
Well, probably...

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:45.450
<i>...fat, ugly, incredibly smelly, 
and bullied to hell and back.</i>

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:47.120
Later, pig!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.340
Don't skip tomorrow!

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:53.890
<i>All students of this school,</i>

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:57.520
<i>stop whatever you're doing and take a seat.</i>

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:00.470
<i>With this sudden, mysterious announcement,</i>

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:02.760
<i>everything changed for me.</i>

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:04.230
Ow!

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:05.640
What the heck?!

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:06.910
Don't pull!

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.680
<i>Hey, everyone.</i>

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:13.480
<i>I am what those in your 
world would call a god.</i>

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.630
God?

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.990
What's going on?

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:20.240
<i>Why am I the only one still like I was?</i>

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:24.210
<i>I'm about to have you all leave this Earth</i>

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.250
<i>and go to another world.</i>

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.750
Huh?!

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.750
<i>Another world?</i>

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:33.750
<i>You will be summoned there as heroes.</i>

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:37.260
<i>What is this thing talking about?</i>

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.280
<i>Now, as my farewell gifts to you,</i>

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:43.510
<i>I'll grant you the power to check your Status.</i>

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:49.280
<i>I'll also grant you the 
Appraisal and Item Box skills.</i>

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:53.150
<i>Status? Skills?</i>

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.020
<i>Is this some RPG?</i>

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.530
<i>Now, you'll be transported in ten minutes.</i>

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:01.110
<i>If you form groups, you'll be 
able to go somewhere safe.</i>

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.540
<i>And... begin!</i>

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.820
What does he mean by this?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.540
Do we have to form groups?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.040
Okay, well, I guess we need to group up.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.890
If we're going, let's all get together.

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:14.420
H-Hey, can I also...

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.420
What's with this guy's Status?!

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.610
Huh? Status?

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.670
Let's see...

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.830
"Race: Barely Human."

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:30.630
"Gender: Creepy Male."

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.010
"Age: 17."

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:36.420
"Level: 1, Attack: 1, Defense: 1, Agility: 1,

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:40.840
Magic Attack: 1, Magic Defense: 1, 
Luck: 0, Charm: Immeasurable."

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:42.450
Your stats are so low!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:47.200
Like we'd let someone who's 
"barely human" into our group.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.920
But that's just what they decided!

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:50.960
You stink!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.460
You stink!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.960
You said it twice...

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.330
<i>Okay, beginning transport!</i>

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.960
Huh?!

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.400
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:08.970
<i>You alone?</i>

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.980
Yes, just me.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:17.580
<i>Hmm... Then I'll grant you 
one more special skill.</i>

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.430
A skill? You mean...

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.440
Huh?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:22.690
<i>Bye, now. I wish you luck.</i>

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.760
H-Hey!

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:36.000
Pretty creepy place he dropped me into...

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:42.260
But my adventure and my new life start here!

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.010
I'm so hungry.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.470
It's been five days and nothing's happened.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.620
And I'm so hungry!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:10.910
Wh-What gives?!

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.450
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:24.720
It's fruit.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.670
It's on the ground.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.180
Fruit!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.280
<i>This is mine.</i>

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.680
<i>I'm not giving it to anyone.</i>

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.530
Food! Yay!

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.460
Wait, is this even edible?

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.940
Skill, Appraise.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:45.990
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:45.990
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.920
Fruit of Evolution?

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:55.160
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:55.160
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.690
Seems kinda shady...

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.930
But in this case, I'll dig in!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.960
Disgusting!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:31.070
<b>Before I Knew It, I Was Living in Another World!</b>

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.230
That was awful.

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:37.240
But it did sate my hunger.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:39.600
<i>Activating the effects of 
the Fruit of Evolution.</i>

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.590
Huh? What? What was that voice?

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.860
Effects? Is something going to happen?

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.610
Nothing's happening!

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:51.860
Well, with that retort out of the way...

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.550
What do I do now?

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:57.370
Okay, I have to secure food first.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:07.130
<i>Those are...</i>

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.380
They're the things from earlier.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.640
<i>Speaking of which...</i>

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.390
<i>Level 120?</i>

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.240
Huh?

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:22.390
120?! I'm only Level 1!

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.270
<i>This is dangerous!</i>

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:26.660
<i>Also, what are they doing?</i>

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.000
<i>Now!</i>

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.440
There's a whole nine of them!

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.200
I can't carry them all.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.160
Oh, Item Box!

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:43.160
Talk about convenient.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.970
What are these?

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.800
Highest Grade Recovery Potions?!

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.180
Lucky me!

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:54.120
I'm taking these, too!

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.310
Wow...

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.550
So this is another world?

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:04.230
Shouta.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.410
Onii-chan.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:06.790
Kenji, Miu.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.810
I'm surprised you found me.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:12.320
Well, we haven't been friends 
since childhood for nothing.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.930
Onii-chan, where's everyone else?

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.070
Don't make me too angry.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.380
That's our Kannazuki-senpai.

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:24.910
Did something happen?

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:30.350
Apparently, Seiichi-kun alone was 
transported to a different location.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:34.590
You think Seiichi's okay?

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:37.930
Is this safe to eat?

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.600
What do question marks mean?

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:43.420
That makes me super hesitant to eat it.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.140
I'm still going to, though.

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.100
Huh? Nothing's happening.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.800
Lucky me!

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.610
Or not!

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.050
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:59.510
<i>This past week, I've been eating 
everything Appraisal reacted to,</i>

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:03.410
<i>and I've acquired all kinds of skills 
like Paralysis Resistance, but now...</i>

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:07.090
<i>If I'm gonna die anyway, 
the last thing I'm doing is...</i>

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.630
...eating this.

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:17.630
<i>I only have two of the nine 
Fruits of Evolution left.</i>

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.350
<i>I never did figure out 
what their effect is, but...</i>

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.550
They still taste awful!

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:28.040
I think I could eat another.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:34.030
<i>Fruit of Evolution, thank you 
for saving me all these times.</i>

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.360
Huh?! I'm completely fine!

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:40.240
Wait, is <i>this</i> the effect of 
the Fruit of Evolution?!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:43.370
In that case, I should have held on to one!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.480
Spit it up!

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:46.670
Spit it up as best you can!

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:49.150
<i>Skill: Poison Resistance acquired.</i>

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:53.380
<i>Skill: Appraisal increased in rank 
to Skill: Advanced Appraisal.</i>

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.680
Huh? Increased in rank?

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.870
Ow!

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:07.460
Blood... I'm bleeding!

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:10.390
Highest Grade Recovery Potion!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:19.150
You bastard! Attack me by surprise, will ya?!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.490
<i>He's strong!</i>

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:34.080
<i>H-He's strong...</i>

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:39.340
<i>Wait, is he going to eat me?</i>

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:49.050
Did my BO just kill him?

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.980
Whoa! Wh-What's all this?!

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:58.510
Clever Monkey Bone, Clever Monkey Meat, 
Clever Monkey Pelt...

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.650
Are these item drops?

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:05.170
<i>Skill: Guillotine Kick, 
Skill: Instant Movement,</i>

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:10.260
<i>Skill: Superior Alchemy, and 
Skill: Tool Creation (Superior) acquired.</i>

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:10.870
Huh?

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.700
From just now?

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:17.000
<i>Clever Monkey's Knowledge</i>?

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:22.840
"Clever Monkeys are monsters of great 
intelligence that live in high-level dungeons.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:27.860
They possess knowledge of herbs, and are 
capable of both alchemy and creating tools."

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:31.340
Wait, how can I read this book?!

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.720
I've never seen this writing before!

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:38.900
<i>I'll grant you one more special skill.</i>

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.480
Was it then?

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:43.190
Is this the Complete Harvesting Skill?

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.590
<i>Now commencing Evolution.</i>

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:46.410
Huh?

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:48.410
Evolution?

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.790
What the heck was that?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.600
Huh? What is this?

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:01.760
I'm thinner?

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.880
<i>What's going on here?!</i>

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.430
Why?!

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:07.200
<b>Pop</b>

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:10.970
My bones! My bones! 
My muscles! Wait, not there!

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:07.450
<b>Crack</b>

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:08.200
<b>Creak</b>

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:08.450
<b>Crunch</b>

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:10.450
<b>Grind</b>

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:10.700
<b>Twinge</b>

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.140
Oh... So that's how I wound up like this?

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.900
<i>Evolution completed.</i>

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:18.570
<i>1,000 added to all stats.</i>

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:19.230
Huh?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:26.820
Mana, Attack, Defense, Agility, 
Magic Attack, Magic Defense, Luck...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.620
Wait, this is crazy!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.990
Why did they suddenly inflate so much?

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:35.810
And my Evolution's only at 1/10?

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:39.500
I can't possibly withstand that 
intense pain nine more times!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:45.510
And why am I still Level 1 after 
defeating that Level 120 Clever Monkey?!

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.200
I hate this!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:53.260
<i>Five months after that whole ordeal...</i>

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:54.520
<b>Five Months Later</b>

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.120
<i>I used the knowledge I acquired 
from the Clever Monkey</i>

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:01.360
<i>to accrue many experiences</i>

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.640
<i>and steadily raise my stats,</i>

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.080
<i>and now I'm...</i>

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:14.140
<i>getting owned by a Level 311 Acrowolf!</i>

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.590
Instant Movement!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.810
Guillotine Kick!

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.150
No way!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:36.970
I'm too strong for Level 1.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.310
O-Oh, no! I defeated it!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.070
<i>Commencing skill collection.</i>

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.720
<i>Acrowolf's Fang,</i>

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:48.170
<i>Acrowolf's Pelt,</i>

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.600
<i>and Acrowolf's Meat acquired.</i>

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:55.080
<i>Skills: Twin Fang Attack, Enemy Detection, 
and Adamant Claws acquired.</i>

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.580
<i>You are now able to utilize water magic.</i>

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.080
Magic?

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:05.100
<i>Legendary Weapon: 
Water Spirit's Dagger acquired.</i>

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:08.440
<i>Confirmed acquisition of a great 
deal of experience points.</i>

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.950
<i>The Acrowolf's Knowledge</i>, huh?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:22.910
If I recall, the Clever Monkey's 
map was black in the same area.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.560
I'll investigate it later.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.330
<i>Now commencing Evolution.</i>

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.650
Huh? Oh, crap!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.310
I forgot this was going to happen!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:33.910
Wait!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.160
Appraise.

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:43.170
Only one more Evolution left, huh?

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:47.450
<i>What's going to happen to me 
once I evolve all the way?</i>

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.260
Clever Monkeys?!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:53.600
I'm surrounded!

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:07.510
Human! Fight me!

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.780
Fight me!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.280
U-Um, can I refuse?

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.570
No.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:17.280
I figured.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:21.750
<i>Damn it. My human rights are 
being denied by a gorilla.</i>

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.210
<i>I guess I should Appraise it.</i>

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.920
<i>What?! It's over Level 700?!</i>

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:35.830
<i>The Kaiser Kong is the boss
of the Clever Monkeys, right?</i>

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:38.430
<i>I guess it's here for revenge.</i>

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.130
Don't worry.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:42.930
I won't let anyone else interfere.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:45.440
No, that's not the problem here.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:48.190
It's all right. It'll be over soon.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:49.070
Hey!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.190
Hey, hold on!

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:57.200
Such incredible power!

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.950
Wh-What is it?

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.350
Amazing!

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:05.570
You dodged my first attack!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.400
That's a first!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.210
Huh?!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:11.320
Why are you blushing over that?!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:15.470
Are you female?! Are you a female gorilla?!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.970
I love strong males!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.890
G-G-Gross!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:24.680
What?!

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:26.390
That was dangerous.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.440
You're one to talk!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.260
Now it's my turn!

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:31.690
Flash Fist!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.190
N-No more...

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:47.320
Amazing!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:50.460
My Flash Fist didn't kill you!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.960
You really were trying to kill me?

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:55.640
I'm even more interested in you now.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:57.970
I want strong males.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.720
No thank you to gorillas.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.220
I'm no gorilla!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.470
I'm Saria.

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:06.980
Eh? Huh?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:08.980
I'm Saria.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.230
Don't repeat it!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:13.230
And why do you have the 
name of a pretty girl?!

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.740
A pretty girl?!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.360
We're not on the same page!

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:20.240
If Guillotine Kick won't work, then...

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:22.200
Adamant Claws!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.060
<i>Again?!</i>

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:29.210
Your skills are amazing!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.210
Oh, is that so?

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.460
Air Thrust!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.600
I thought I was done for.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.270
What a gorilla.

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:49.210
Now if it'll keep this up and destroy itself...

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.210
You're perfectly fine!

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.600
I'm shocked.

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:58.240
I didn't think you'd dodge Air Thrust, too.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.210
It's too strong.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.240
Okay, in that case...

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.290
I've never tried this before,

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:06.410
but I'll have to use magic!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.250
Come forth, Water Spirit's Dagger!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:14.790
This amplifies the effects of water magic

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.130
and reduces the mana it consumes.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.630
Oho?

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:20.010
Take this!

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.640
Fall Disaster!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.270
Huh?

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:40.570
You're not bad.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.820
No, no, you did that to yourself.

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.200
<i>Gah!</i>

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:49.330
<i>A gorilla just called me out on 
something that's totally true!</i>

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:52.330
Now, let's continue!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.080
Flash Fist!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.760
Flash Fist! Flash Fist! Flash Fist!
Flash Fist! Flash Fist!

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:08.770
Flash Fist!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:15.100
<i>Am I... going to die here?</i>

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.120
You stink!

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.720
You stink!

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:20.810
Do your best, even at different school.

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:24.990
Seiichi, you have the most 
optimism of anyone in the world.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:30.380
<i>Think.</i>

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:33.970
<i>Skills aren't working, 
and I can't use magic properly.</i>

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:38.090
<i>There must be something... 
some other option left for me...</i>

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.220
This is the end!

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.470
Stench Performer!

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.290
<i>N-Not enough?</i>

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:56.730
<i>Farewell, everyone!</i>

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.270
O-Oh, no!

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:05.780
I love you!

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:07.900
What?

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:10.030
Marry me right now!

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:13.060
Huh?! Wait, wha... eh...

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:16.000
What?!

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.830
<i>Wait, wait! The beautiful woman 
from the beginning hasn't shown up,</i>

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.300
<i>and it's just ending here?!</i>

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.170
<i>What do I do?!</i>

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:25.970
<i>What's gonna happen to my 
life in another world?!</i>

