00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.130
I don't know if I should be 
happy about that or lament it.

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:33.050
Don't go recalling it, you damn gorilla!

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:37.890
I suddenly start my 
newlywed life with a gorilla.

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:40.020
